From: Haldexx
Subject: [PATCH] power: make the double-tap-to-wake node group-writable

The power HAL runs as root in group system and writes
/sys/class/dt2w/enabled. With mode 0644 root needs CAP_DAC_OVERRIDE,
which SELinux enforcing denies.

---
diff --git a/ramdisk/etc/init.power.rc b/ramdisk/etc/init.power.rc
--- a/ramdisk/etc/init.power.rc
+++ b/ramdisk/etc/init.power.rc
@@ -230,4 +230,4 @@
 
     # DT2W
     chown system system /sys/class/dt2w/enabled
-    chmod 0644 /sys/class/dt2w/enabled
+    chmod 0664 /sys/class/dt2w/enabled
